OL,3,GNEWSAStretch of A38 closed after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A38 in Derbyshire has been
OL,7,Fclosed following a multi-vehicle crash.
OL,9,FNational Highways said on Saturday
OL,10,Fafternoon the northbound carriageway of
OL,11,Fthe A38 was closed between its
OL,12,Fjunctions with the A50 and the A516.
OL,14,FDerbyshire Police and East Midlands
OL,15,FAmbulance Service were in attendance,
OL,16,Fit added.
OL,18,FIn a post on social media, National
OL,19,FHighways said one mile of congestion
OL,20,Fhad built up.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
